  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15 ounce) package refrigerated pie crusts",
    "0.25 cup strawberry jam, divided",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 tablespoon water, or as needed",
    "1 tablespoon colored decorating sugar, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oOsxBRMJ9o__kAZAxdnWIvGZCX4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-step-01-3e0557591384499b9bd930cb09d0056c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unroll pie crusts, place on a lightly floured work surface, and roll slightly with a rolling pin to square the edges. Cut each crust into 8 equal-sized rectangles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cehjcoAxnu3-GHqrexDmu35ZuYs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-step-02-828d06dc01954afca6fe5a207ffde7ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place about 1 tablespoon strawberry jam in the center of 8 squares. Spread jam out to within 1/4-inch of the edge. Top each with another pastry square and use a fork to crimp together, sealing in jam. Use a knife to trim pastries, if desired. Transfer filled pastries to the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OZkaIvOPiVp1Qc5IJYveLL2nASI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-step-03-207ef74986e64791a53921b87d515bd2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are lightly golden brown, about 7 minutes. Allow to cool on the baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HoYRLg-EoesfaB5emivqDRCxl18=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-step-04-8d406c9775f04f76968fced48903f2cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk confectioners' sugar, milk, and vanilla extract in a bowl to make a spreadable frosting. Add water, a few drops at a time, if needed. Spread cooled tarts with frosting and sprinkle with colored sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jMbNdGCbsb5uWRdYXgRQh6qfgFE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-step-05-c1293c0ba8c8406fa8eaf0a3fb8ff9a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u1FqsARQqF9z2LdUZFmiVIQt8l8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213567-home-made-top-tarts-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-d2dbd5ef83844927be819da7f3610c05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213567/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
